# Production DB administration template
#
# This file is safe to commit because it contains placeholders only.
# Copy to `.env.prod` only when a reviewed production DB administration task
# requires a local connection string. Never commit `.env.prod`.
#
# Application runtime values are provided by SST:
# - NextAuthSecret: SST Secret
# - NextAuthUrl: SST Secret
# - DATABASE_URL: built by sst.config.ts from the linked Aurora resource
#
# There is no `DatabaseUrl` SST Secret in the current architecture.
#
# IMPORTANT: the repository does not currently contain prisma/migrations history.
# Do not run `npm run db:push:prod` against an existing production database
# without a backup, schema comparison, and an explicit reviewed plan.

DATABASE_URL="postgresql://<user>:<password>@<aurora-endpoint>:5432/stordex?sslmode=require"
NEXTAUTH_SECRET="<only-if-required-for-a-local-admin-task>"
NEXTAUTH_URL="https://<production-host>"
APP_ENV="prod"
